  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accountability Programme - To support interventions that strengthen government accountability in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve government accountability from the local level up by building the capacity of citizens to better understand, articulate, and call for their needs to be met.  It will also provide support to government bodies in order to respond to this demand.</narrative>
  </description>
